{
  "bodyHash": "9PAZ2uUAsdM=",
  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3e63cb7e-30cf-4305-a868-85f4719ee261.png\"></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>Outbreak 旨在為 Minecraft 帶來靈感來自其他媒體的末日怪物。</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>主要特色：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>非常適合<strong>殭屍末日模組包</strong>！</li>\n<li><strong>爆頭！</strong>擊中怪物頭部可將其頭顱打飛。</li>\n<li><strong>時尚盔甲！</strong>消滅怪物時也能保持帥氣。</li>\n<li><strong>輕量級！</strong>本模組僅新增怪物與少數盔甲套裝。</li>\n<li><strong>可設定！</strong>可透過設定檔調整怪物的生命值與傷害。</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>目前已新增的主題：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>殺戮空間</li>\n</ul><p>建議搭配 <span style=\"color:#67879c\"><strong><a style=\"color:#67879c\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless&amp;Classics(TaCZ)</a></strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-lesraisins-tactical-equipements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins 戰術裝備</a></strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Extra Gore</strong></a></span></p><p>需要 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>‼</strong><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\">若您發現任何與此模組相關的錯誤，請隨時在留言區回報，我會盡快修復。</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><strong>‼</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c844bf26-95db-43e4-ab62-3827f5b6ca70.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">怪物：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>小型類別 // **微不足道的目標**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>囊腫</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3e328143-e0d9-41f9-b8b1-7edac4ac7b2e.png\" width=\"266\" height=\"380\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c0f0d9cb-f2a6-49f5-8af5-d7008cc4e064.gif\" width=\"387\" height=\"516\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>血塊</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_211c980f-976f-437e-82a2-00ffcdefd8fa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"379\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_bb4d5105-e4f2-4e2f-9b17-7c6a122163b0.gif\" width=\"282\" height=\"376\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">囊腫與血塊生命值低，但會成群出現。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>嗜血者</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0cec0985-ff88-4cb1-acf0-59b5eaae0fd6.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"368\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_5b3eb865-6f7b-4b16-9b6f-b309b9dc8cdd.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"533\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">嗜血者移動迅速，難以瞄準。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>爬行者</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_e7bbe29b-d9d1-41d4-889a-44cfa665ae7d.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"341\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_71bae653-b7cb-4fe3-9510-c7eb604a534d.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">爬行者像蜘蛛一樣爬牆，碰撞箱較小，黑色皮膚使其在黑暗環境中極具威脅。</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#727e5e\"><strong>潛行者</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_1ac4f4c6-65aa-4b4c-8cd6-3a6083ded0b9.png\" width=\"351\" height=\"337\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_8cfe5568-099c-43e9-bcaf-d7480f3cf339.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">潛行者幾乎完全隱形，只有在接近到足以對你出手時才會現身。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">留意漂浮的白眼睛，或者裝備福斯特面具可揭露周圍所有潛行者。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#8bbb3d\"><strong>噴吐者</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_cc8dca8a-a20b-4075-aa7c-274fe66013e2.png\" width=\"401\" height=\"490\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_aa9c3299-a182-4058-993f-a8de096652dd.gif\" width=\"521\" height=\"694\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">顧名思義，噴吐者會噴出有毒黏液，在落地點短暫殘留。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">這些傢伙能從相當遠的距離發動攻擊，利用側移來避免持續傷害。</p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>中型類別 // **中等威脅**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#cbbc80\"><strong>浮腫者</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20bbf106-630f-4dcb-ab20-92e2f31a7b98.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"491\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_55863e36-e75d-41a3-81a2-1779fee5f931.gif\" width=\"381\" height=\"508\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">浮腫者會噴出酸液使你中毒。其腫脹的腹部若承受過多傷害會爆炸，優先攻擊頭部以避免爆炸。</p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>骸殼</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_96e809fa-d52e-46c5-87b4-be30280ed789.png\" width=\"378\" height=\"451\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_fa876fa6-e523-4cc6-a664-7576342233f0.gif\" width=\"468\" height=\"624\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">骸殼是遠程攻擊者，會從遠處發射火球。試著在它們忙於瞄準時側移。</p>\n<h3 style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b19492\"><strong>女妖</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7a767e0e-d729-47d6-ba77-363c92c33022.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"467\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ef7effc9-eeae-408a-bf6a-3efb832440a1.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">女妖發出刺耳尖叫，攻擊範圍涵蓋周圍360度。若不迅速處理，傷害會快速疊加。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">裝備斯卡莉面罩可讓使用者免疫女妖尖叫。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>大型類別 // **極度危險**</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#405ca1\"><strong>碎顱者</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_13b99890-c1b0-4f90-97ae-36faa61127f2.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"402\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_2437990b-1404-45aa-8042-71a2ba1e7622.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_3ff83b61-c545-4445-960f-70171058f29b.gif\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">碎顱者是狂暴的怪物，會拿著電鋸衝向你。務必在交戰前保持距離，因為它們相當耐打。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#c47070\">血肉壓迫者</span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7f62d5e6-d820-40b5-af00-c38eeb412f20.png\" width=\"620\" height=\"604\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_d53ac45b-e8a2-4a3c-a301-a698a01e5d29.gif\" width=\"450\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">這名為血肉壓迫者的高聳恐懼存在移動迅速、皮厚耐打，會將擋路的一切撕成碎片。不建議直接正面對抗。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">相反地，應設置陷阱困住它們，或組隊圍攻以確保生存。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">炸藥對血肉壓迫者也有極佳效果。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c0b2cb11-f207-49f8-9727-21f7dd9e576f.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">物品：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>生物樣本：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_26fb4c28-2cb5-4148-b1c3-cf4d65260abe.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">由本模組多數怪物掉落，怪物越大，掉落的生物樣本越多。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>生物纖維：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_44dbbae5-8743-41ba-a68d-58b947e66072.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">將生物樣本與線結合製作而成，用於裝備合成。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_78c94348-f8fd-4058-abd3-ab3357347bd8.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>盔甲碎片：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_7d88beb4-8c85-4879-a853-cf2f02d7873e.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">擊殺<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>大型</strong></span>怪物獲得。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h1><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_dbd3fdb9-4e8d-4c9d-a6f2-b74aa26a4bb3.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">盔甲：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#727e5e\"><strong>霍茲恩標記7型裝甲：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73d96b6a-4001-4356-8ace-9b4bc1098220.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cfe41b68-23cc-4499-9b3f-e29970e7f388.png\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_318a6993-f908-4f68-a013-635932ddaf90.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_94109505-c205-491b-92f9-b350a908dcad.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_47139f92-a9c4-4414-851b-f3e5df68302f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_34fca0dc-1768-49c9-b006-8a12a8e1a5bd.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>DJ Scully 造型服裝：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_bc9d9dd3-8080-47b3-b45d-0ce09a7d5a92.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"504\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ec7a0f59-05a0-4552-8395-d27fa5487003.png\" width=\"269\" height=\"498\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_5498bf1e-c96c-4bd8-b32b-0af167fd244c.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_266864c2-84c1-4d77-9daa-d498505227e1.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_a50009b5-0ab7-426a-a9a5-02817a68db65.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c907b8e2-1238-4d0f-a5a3-3e3897761ffe.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>鑄造廠工作服：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_0e231c1d-bd7f-43c9-8d2b-86c7c9de13f1.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"541\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_92379f07-9f72-4915-8adc-f7cb5387e159.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_fa337db8-93b8-4c60-9cac-12eaffeca027.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"225\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_a3cd0b92-ab57-4479-bd54-41927a35a91f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_73ef2ad1-d20d-4c35-a8c9-e1a880a2690f.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>佛斯特先生造型服裝：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c818bdb8-811d-4583-aaf7-23857989f87d.png\" width=\"280\" height=\"571\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_c6ed2e79-5c67-470a-871b-6c71284b6c9b.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"568\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成配方：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_d3d89494-f931-4c82-b62a-8e5d53d74b09.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"223\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_305162db-129d-4fc2-a1d8-b3b6339f45c2.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"225\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1394128/description_ff44b888-cf3e-4736-aa35-ecf7be442cd9.png\" width=\"449\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>",
